  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The development objective of the project is to support the GoS in addressing the structural hazard of the river water collector of the Veliki Krivelj tailings disposal facility, which is one of the most urgent environmental legacy issues of the mining sector in the Bor region.</narrative>
  </description>
